{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "game3d-rigged-character",
  "title": "3D 角色绑骨与动作管线",
  "titleEn": "3D Rigged Character Pipeline",
  "summary": "T-Pose设定图→3D网格生成→自动骨骼蒙皮→动作库重定向→低模重拓扑与FBX导出",
  "category": "game",
  "tags": [
    "3D角色建模",
    "自动绑骨蒙皮",
    "动作重定向",
    "低模重拓扑",
    "GLB转FBX",
    "Unity/Godot/UE"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": {
    "name": "AIArtEngine",
    "url": "https://github.com/Justin-sky/ai-art-engine"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "cover": "cover.png",
  "requires": {
    "nodeTypes": [
      "asset.image",
      "asset.model3d",
      "model.convert",
      "model.retarget",
      "model.retopology",
      "model.rigSkin",
      "note.text"
    ],
    "appMinVersion": "7.1.0"
  },
  "plan": {
    "title": "3D 游戏角色生成、绑骨蒙皮、动作与减面管线",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "key": "tposeRef",
        "typeId": "asset.image",
        "title": "角色标准 T-Pose 正交参考图",
        "params": {
          "generateTransparentBg": true,
          "generateAspectRatio": "1:1",
          "generateInstruction": "3D 游戏角色建模专用标准正面正交 T-Pose 全身设定图：双臂水平向两侧平举（或标准 A-Pose 45° 自然张开），双腿微开站立，无披风或长发遮挡腋下与胯部关节，结构对称清晰，PBR 金属皮革材质细节分明，原生透明背景（RGBA 透明通道）"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "charModel",
        "typeId": "asset.model3d",
        "title": "生成 3D 角色网格（GLB）",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "基于输入 T-Pose 设定图生成完整对称的 3D 游戏角色模型，四肢独立无粘连，带完整 PBR 贴图"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "rigSkin",
        "typeId": "model.rigSkin",
        "title": "自动骨骼蒙皮（Humanoid Rig）",
        "params": {
          "generateRigType": "humanoid",
          "generateInstruction": "标准人形骨骼自动绑定与权重蒙皮"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "retargetAnim",
        "typeId": "model.retarget",
        "title": "3D 动作库绑定（待机/奔跑/攻击）",
        "params": {
          "retargetOutFormat": "glb",
          "retargetBakeAnimation": true,
          "retargetExportWithGeometry": true,
          "retargetAnimateInPlace": true
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "lowPolyModel",
        "typeId": "model.retopology",
        "title": "游戏引擎低模重拓扑（Retopology）",
        "params": {
          "retopologyMode": "smart",
          "retopologyQuad": true,
          "retopologyBake": true
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "fbxConvert",
        "typeId": "model.convert",
        "title": "引擎就绪 FBX/GLB 标准化导出",
        "params": {
          "convertFormat": "FBX",
          "convertPivotToCenterBottom": true,
          "convertBake": true,
          "convertWithAnimation": true
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "note",
        "typeId": "note.text",
        "title": "3D 游戏角色全流程管线说明",
        "params": {
          "text": "3D 游戏角色工业级全链路：\n1. 【关节无遮挡 T-Pose 锚点】：tposeRef 生成双臂平举、双腿分离、无披风粘连的正交透明全身像，连入 charModel:in-image 生成四肢干净分离的 3D 角色网格。\n2. 【自动绑骨与动作重定向】：charModel → rigSkin（自动植入标准人形骨骼与蒙皮权重）→ retargetAnim（勾选 retargetAnimateInPlace=true 原地动作烘焙，支持待机、奔跑、跳跃、挥砍等游戏动作库）→ fbxConvert（将原点归中到脚底中心 convertPivotToCenterBottom=true 并导出 FBX/GLB）。\n3. 【低模减面旁路】：charModel → lowPolyModel（model.retopology）一键生成四边面低模并烘焙法线贴图。"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "tposeRef",
        "to": "charModel",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "charModel",
        "to": "rigSkin",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-model"
      },
      {
        "from": "rigSkin",
        "to": "retargetAnim",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-model"
      },
      {
        "from": "retargetAnim",
        "to": "fbxConvert",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-model"
      },
      {
        "from": "charModel",
        "to": "lowPolyModel",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-model"
      }
    ]
  }
}
